[[7143,2747,"The defibrillator machine did not work, even when the battery pack was changed","defibrillator failure",""],[7144,2747,"The defibrillator had not been checked on 5 November, although there was a requirement for the equipment to be checked daily for serviceability by the nursing staff","lack of daily equipment checks",""],[7145,2747,"There was no 'cross-check' or 'double check' system in place","absence of double check system",""],[7146,2747,"There was no policy or protocol in place at the hospital for the management of sudden / unexpected deaths","missing death management policy",""]]